        "At a young age we have watched his competitive spirit develop from the time he was little. We're a football family, and when Ryan's older brothers were playing, we got them involved in wrestling during the off season to help keep them in shape for football, and of course, Ryan followed right along. At just eight years old, Ryan started wrestling.",
